stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ON_SALE: product published
    ON_SALE --> RESERVED: offer accepted
    RESERVED --> ON_SALE: order cancelled and listing eligible
    RESERVED --> HIDDEN: cancelled after moderation or deletion
    RESERVED --> SOLD: both parties confirm completion

    state OrderLifecycle {
      [*] --> PENDING_CONFIRM: accepted offer creates order
      PENDING_CONFIRM --> MEETUP_ARRANGED: both confirm same meetup version
      MEETUP_ARRANGED --> COMPLETED: both confirm completion
      PENDING_CONFIRM --> CANCELLED: participant cancels
      MEETUP_ARRANGED --> CANCELLED: participant cancels before completion confirmation
      MEETUP_ARRANGED --> DISPUTED: participant disabled
      MEETUP_ARRANGED --> PENDING_CONFIRM: meetup proposal changed
    }

    COMPLETED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    DISPUTED --> CANCELLED: authorized manual cancellation
